Thu Nov 26 10:10:02 UTC 2026 - Jordi Relats <4889953+jordirelats@users.noreply.github.com>

- Update to 0.5.2:
  * Fix a freeze of the whole computer: going through the rows of
    Updates (ticking them off one by one) started two zypper processes
    per row; the package card now waits until the selection stops and
    no more than two zypper queries of the window run at once
  * Updates: "Mark all" and "Unmark all"
  * Programs from the web show their icons (also for programs that keep
    their icon outside the icon theme, like Weasis or AutoFirma)
  * Repositories: "Refresh" with nothing selected refreshes them all

